relate to a shifting sense of national identity, towards examining the \u201cEnglishness\u201d of British national cinema, will be highlighted. This course is offered through the Summer Abroad program.", "title": "Aspects of a National Cinema", "levelOfInstruction": "undergraduate", "prerequisitesText": null, "corequisitesText": null, "exclusionsText": null, "recommendedPreparation": null, "note": null, "division": "Arts and Science, Faculty of", "breadthRequirements": ["Creative and Cultural Representations (1)"], "distributionRequirements": ["Humanities"], "publicationSections": ["Cinema Studies Institute"], "cmPublicationSections": [{"section": "Cinema Studies Institute", "subSections": null}]}, "created": "2026-01-24@20:57:47.921", "modified": null, "lastSaved": 0, "primaryTeachMethod": "LEC", "faculty": {"code": "ARTSC", "name": "Faculty of Arts and Science"}, "coSec": {"code": "", "name": null}, "department": {"code": "CINE", "name": "Cinema Studies Institute"}, "title": null, "maxCredit": 1.0, "minCredit": 1.0, "breadths": [{"org": {"code": "APSC", "name": "Faculty of Applied Science & Engineering"}, "breadthTypes": [{"kind": "ELECTIVE", "type": "Compl Studies", "description": "Complementary Studies", "code": "CS"}]}, {"org": {"code": "ERIN", "name": "University of Toronto Mississauga"}, "breadthTypes": [{"kind": "DISTRIBUTION", "type": "Humanities", "description": "Humanities", "code": "Hum"}]}, {"org": {"code": "ARTSC", "name": "Faculty of Arts and Science"}, "breadthTypes": [{"kind": "BREADTH", "type": "Creative Cultural", "description": "BR=1 Creative and Cultural Representation", "code": "BR=1"}]}], "notes": [{"name": "Course Note", "type": "COURSE", "content": "<p><strong>Timetable Instructions</strong></p><p>Students wishing to take this Summer Abroad course must submit a Summer Abroad application. Instructions on how to apply for Summer Abroad courses and deadlines are posted on the Summer Abroad website: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"h